==Notes==
*Seems to spawn northeast of [[Destiny's Gorge]] [[zone]] point only if you enter the zone from another zone point.
*In the Scar, Jewk Swem Pleg shares the same spawn point with [[Rept Parn Freg]], [[Graf Wask Derg]], and [[Sheg Zamn Mada]]. Each will follow the same patrol route.
*In Diviner's Ascent, Jewk Swem Pleg shares the same spawn point with [[Graf Wask Derg]], [[Brol Migo Hinga]], [[Chak Hack Schawack]], and [[Sheg Zamn Mada]]. Each will follow the same patrol route.
*This boss and the hydras accompanying it may run incredibly fast, making it impossible to catch them if they are going in the opposite direction of you.
*In Vulture Drifts, he may get stuck at the Irridescent Griffon Wing collector, near the teleporter on the right of the map.

== Trivia ==
* All Hydra bosses have one name for each head.
